sect1.para:
  The result of the modulo operator % has the same sign
  as the dividend — that is, the result of $a % $b
  will have the same sign as $a. For example:

   The Modulo Operator


<?php
var_dump(5 % 3);
var_dump(5 % -3);
var_dump(-5 % 3);
var_dump(-5 % -3);
?>


   &example.outputs;


int(2)
int(2)
int(-2)
int(-2)
